cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "GYN-OBV: Goiânia Open Buildings Validation dataset"
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-01"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/luizmlpascoal/geoinfo-dataset-gyn_obv"
abstract: >-
  Building-level visual validation and typology labels (16 classes, construction-standard
  flag and year of emergence) for 55,590 Google Open Buildings v3 footprints lying outside
  the municipal lot base or on lots registered as vacant in Goiânia, Brazil. Labels were
  produced by trained inspectors on Google Earth historical imagery, Street View and Geo360 and
  approved by a supervisor. No owner, cadastral or address information is included.
keywords:
  - open building footprints
  - visual validation
  - building typology
  - cadastre
  - Goiânia
  - GeoAI
